				610,
				"{\"version\":5,\"editMode\":\"segment\",\"totalFrames\":610,\"frameRate\":24,\"video\":{\"fileName\":\"\",\"videoFile\":\"\",\"subfolder\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"frames\":[],\"frameMap\":[]},\"videoClips\":[],\"global\":{\"taskType\":\"t2v — 文生视频(Text to Video)\",\"prompt\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"referenceVideo\":{\"videoFile\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"\",\"type\":\"input\",\"subfolder\":\"\"},\"continuousReference\":false,\"sourceWidth\":728,\"sourceHeight\":1280,\"refVideos\":[],\"commonEnabled\":false,\"commonCollapsed\":false,\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"\"}},\"output\":{\"mode\":\"fixed\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3 (标准)\",\"megapixels\":0.6,\"multiple\":32,\"longEdge\":928,\"width\":928,\"height\":672,\"maxExportFrames\":0,\"exportMode\":\"all\",\"audioMode\":\"generate\",\"continuityEnabled\":true,\"continuityOverlapFrames\":5},\"runSelectEnabled\":false,\"runSelection\":[],\"liveTaePreview\":true,\"segments\":[{\"id\":\"msn76wqv9v0ne\",\"start\":0,\"length\":243,\"frameCount\":243,\"durationSec\":10,\"prompt\":\"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a wide long shot frames a young woman riding a surfboard across a vivid blue sea under bright sunlight, her full body visible from head to toe as she balances on the board with arms outstretched, wearing a fitted swimsuit, her hair flowing in the sea breeze. White spray fans out behind the surfboard while gentle blue waves roll around her. The camera performs a tracking shot, following her across the water at medium amplitude and normal speed for about five seconds. [Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to a close shot framing the woman from the waist up as she continues surfing. Droplets of seawater cling to her skin and hair, her expression bright and relaxed as she leans slightly forward, adjusts her balance, and smiles toward the open sea. The blue ocean shimmers softly out of focus behind her while sunlight catches the water droplets.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Ocean waves roll steadily across the blue sea while wind sweeps over the water surface. The surfboard slices through the waves with continuous splashing, seawater sprays behind the board, and the woman breathes lightly with an occasional soft laugh as she rides the waves.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: A bright acoustic-guitar rhythm at a moderate tempo, layered with light percussion and soft synth pads that build gradually and fade out near the end.\",\"negativePrompt\":\"\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[],\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"1f544534d332e0cb5e600f8477aed8d87a2085790fb4879588c7ab12bceb76eb.jpg\",\"fileName\":\"\"},\"continuityFromPrev\":false},{\"id\":\"mssxgstnle4l6\",\"start\":243,\"length\":243,\"frameCount\":243,\"durationSec\":10,\"prompt\":\"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the shot opens on a close framing of the young woman from the waist up as she surfs across a vivid blue sea, the same woman with flowing hair and a fitted swimsuit. Seawater droplets cling to her skin and hair, glittering in the sunlight, her expression focused and joyful. The camera pulls out at slow speed with large amplitude, gradually revealing her full body and then the wide open seascape. As the framing widens, she performs a graceful carve: she bends her knees low, sweeps one arm toward the wave face, then rises smoothly and extends both arms for balance while the surfboard cuts a fan of white spray behind her. Her hair and the flying spray catch the sunlight, blue waves rolling gently around her until the end of the shot.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Ocean waves roll steadily across the blue sea while wind sweeps over the water surface. The surfboard carves through the waves with continuous splashing, a sharp rush of spray fans out during the turn, and the woman breathes lightly with a soft joyful laugh.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: Acoustic-guitar arpeggios at a moderate tempo, joined by light percussion and airy synth pads that build gradually in volume before fading out at the end.\",\"negativePrompt\":\"\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[],\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"\"},\"continuityFromPrev\":true},{\"id\":\"mssy2til8bklf\",\"start\":486,\"length\":124,\"frameCount\":124,\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"\",\"negativePrompt\":\"\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"refAudios\":[],\"refVideos\":[],\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"\",\"fileName\":\"\"},\"continuityFromPrev\":true}],\"timelineMode\":\"prompt_batch\",\"width\":928,\"height\":672,\"refMaxSize\":928,\"shots\":[{\"id\":\"msn76wqv9v0ne\",\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"startImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"1f544534d332e0cb5e600f8477aed8d87a2085790fb4879588c7ab12bceb76eb.jpg\",\"width\":728,\"height\":1280},\"endImage\":null}],\"keyframes\":[{\"id\":\"msn76wqv9v0ne\",\"imageFile\":\"1f544534d332e0cb5e600f8477aed8d87a2085790fb4879588c7ab12bceb76eb.jpg\",\"width\":728,\"height\":1280,\"start\":0,\"length\":124,\"frameCount\":124,\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"\",\"negativePrompt\":\"bad video\",\"isStartFrame\":true,\"isEndFrame\":false}],\"durationSec\":5,\"gen\":{\"defaultFrameCount\":124}}",
